# Expanding Data Sources

One of the most effective ways to improve detection quality is to increase telemetry coverage.

Recommended data sources include:

### Identity

- Microsoft Entra ID
- Active Directory
- Okta

### Endpoint

- Microsoft Defender for Endpoint
- Windows Security Events
- Linux Syslog

### Network

- Azure Firewall
- Palo Alto Networks
- Cisco ASA
- Fortinet

### Cloud

- Microsoft Defender for Cloud
- AWS CloudTrail
- Google Cloud Audit Logs

### Applications

- Web applications
- Databases
- API gateways
- Business applications

Correlating multiple data sources provides significantly more context during investigations.

