# Threat Intelligence Integration

Production SOCs should enrich detections with external intelligence.

Useful indicators include:

- Malicious IP addresses.
- Domains.
- URLs.
- File hashes.
- Email addresses.

Threat intelligence can improve prioritization and reduce investigation time by adding context to observed activity.

