# Detection Validation

Every production detection should be validated before deployment.

Validation should confirm:

- Query accuracy.
- Data availability.
- Threshold effectiveness.
- Entity mapping.
- MITRE ATT&CK mapping.
- Expected alert volume.

Regular testing helps maintain confidence in detection quality.

